# 50 Hours: A Core Curriculum for College Students.

**Authors:** Cheney, Lynne V.

## Abstract
Points out the need for improving the nation's higher education curricula. Offers reasons for supporting a core curriculum and describes difficulties in developing such a program. Provides a summary of the National Endowment for the Humanities' report &quot;50 Hours: A Core Curriculum for College Students.&quot; (KO)

